# Thermal System - Room Temperature / Heating Power
# First Order System
#
# Model: Cth*dT/dt + T/Rth = P/Rth  (simplified)
# H(p) = Rth / (1 + Rth*Cth*p)
#
# Rth = 0.05 K/W, Cth = 10000 J/K
# K = Rth = 0.05 K/W, tau = Rth*Cth = 500 s
#
# Numerator coefficients (ascending powers of p)
: 0.05
# Denominator coefficients (ascending powers of p)
:: 1 500
